## Repo-Specific Context

### Architecture
```
Trigger (CLI/API) → CF Worker → CF Queue → Durable Objects → AI Providers
                                                  ↓
                                          D1 (Stats) + R2 (Transcripts)
                                                  ↓
                                          CF Pages (Astro Frontend)
```

### Key Files Reference

| Purpose | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Game types | `src/engine/types.ts` |
| Worker types | `src/worker/types.ts` |
| Game logic | `src/engine/Game.ts` |
| Game state | `src/engine/GameState.ts` |
| Phase handlers | `src/engine/phases/` |
| API routes | `src/worker/routes/` |
| Durable Object | `src/worker/GameRunner.ts` |
| AI providers | `src/worker/ai/` |
| Database service | `src/worker/db/service.ts` |
| Frontend pages | `frontend/src/pages/` |
| Frontend components | `frontend/src/components/` |
| Migrations | `migrations/` |

### Testing Setup
- **Framework:** Vitest
- **Test location:** Co-located `*.test.ts` or `__tests__/` folders
- **Mocks:** `src/engine/__tests__/mocks/`
- **Config:** `vitest.config.ts`

### Common Commands
```bash
# Development
timeout 30s pnpm build
# pnpm dev - run in background mode

# Testing
timeout 60s pnpm test
timeout 120s pnpm test:coverage
timeout 60s pnpm typecheck

# Database
timeout 30s wrangler d1 migrations list --local
